  "description": "HEVC (H.265) decoding for Egami.Video, in managed code: Main, Main 10, Main 12 and the format range extensions to 12 bits, in MP4, MOV, Matroska and raw .h265 files, through Egami.Heic's HEVC decoder. HEVC is covered by patents; Egami's authors grant no patent rights and are not lawyers. Whether you need a patent licence depends on your country and on how you use and distribute this package; commercial products may need one from the HEVC patent pools or holders. Egami.Video itself contains no HEVC decoder and does not depend on this package.",
